==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s (1,600%) spawn, delay 1~6 seconds<sup>30f~180f</sup>.
*100 [[Mooth]]s spawn, delay 1~6 seconds<sup>30f~180f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**1 [[R.Ost]] spawns.
**1 [[R.Ost]] spawns.
**1 [[R.Ost]] spawns.

==Strategy==
If enough Mooths are behind the enemy base and can not be hit, the R.Osts can NOT spawn due to the enemy cap being full. This can be done by allowing low-damaging stalling units to hit the base while the Mooths stack up behind it, thus hogging the enemy limit.

