==Trivia==
*Sin and Punishment is a reference to ''[[wikipedia:Crime and Punishment|Crime and Punishment]]'', a novel written by Russian author [[wikipedia:Fyodor Dostoevsky|Fyodor Dostoevsky]].
*Sin and Punishment's Japanese name, Chazai ~ Giru Ti ~ (茶罪～ギル・ティ～, "Tea Sin ~ Guil-Tea ~"), is a reference to the ''[[wikipedia:Touhou Project|Touhou Project]]'' doujin circle [https://guiltea.booth.pm/ Tsumicha-Guiltea] (罪茶-Guiltea, "Sin Tea-Guiltea") with the kanji 罪 (sin) and 茶 (tea) swapped.

